            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu Gehazi akaingia nyumbani kwa Elisha na kuanza kumhudumia. Elisha akamwuliza, “Ulikwenda wapi?” Gehazi akajibu, “Sikuenda mahali popote.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.25",
